<span id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#00008C;">Key Takeaway<span id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p2.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Precision importance can be predicted from internal model signals using only a few unlabeled calibration prompts, without requiring task-specific evaluation metrics.</span></span></span>
