<p id="S4.SS3.p1.3" class="ltx_p">The equality constraint compares the learned schedule with uniform precision at the same modeled budget, and the uniform schedule is always feasible. We use dynamic programming over windows and the cumulative budget. For integer-valued costs (or costs expressed in a common integer unit), let <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{k}(z)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{k}(z)</annotation></semantics></math> be the largest surrogate benefit attainable by allocating budget <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z</annotation></semantics></math> to the first <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> windows. With <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{0}(0)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{0}(0)=0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{0}(z)=-\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{0}(z)=-\infty</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, the recurrence is</p>
