<p id="A4.p4.1" class="ltx_p">The dynamic program requires <math id="A4.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O(KC_{0}|\mathcal{B}|)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(KC_{0}|\mathcal{B}|)</annotation></semantics></math> time and <math id="A4.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O(KC_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(KC_{0})</annotation></semantics></math> memory, where <math id="A4.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> is expressed in a common integer cost unit. Its optimality guarantee applies to the additive surrogate of Eq. (<a href="#S4.E5" title="In 4.3 Optimal Budget-Constrained Scheduling ‣ 4 Method ‣ Different Tasks, Different Timesteps: Temporal Task-Aware Quantization for Diffusion Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>), not to downstream task accuracy. Rational costs can be converted into integer costs using a common exact scaling.</p>
